src/augmix.py adapts operator parameterization and convex mixing from
augmentations.py and cifar.py in the above repository. The original copyright
and license header are retained. This NOTICE is a project attribution record,
not an assertion that the upstream repository supplied a NOTICE file.

Project modifications: explicit configuration validation; shared crop/flip base;
course-data-only integration; existing split normalization; stable log-space
FP32 three-view Jensen-Shannon loss; deterministic resume identity and tests.
No author architecture, pretrained weights, external data, or dataset-download
and external-corruption evaluation code is included.

Paper: Hendrycks, Mu, Cubuk, Zoph, Gilmer, Lakshminarayanan (ICLR 2020),
"AugMix: A Simple Data Processing Method to Improve Robustness and Uncertainty"
https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.02781

